			"styles": "\n\t/* a condition prelude holding only comments still emits them: the query has no\n\tparts, and the whole prelude span is the comments' only carrier */\n\t@container /* c */;\n\n\t@container /* c */ /* d */ {\n\t\tdiv {\n\t\t\tcolor: red;\n\t\t}\n\t}\n\n\t@container b /* c */ {\n\t\tdiv {\n\t\t\tcolor: red;\n\t\t}\n\t}\n",
